        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Entrepreneur, Optimize\n- Companies: Lifted Research Group\n- Topics: entrepreneurship, small business management, business publishing\n\nFacts:\n- Entrepreneur is an American magazine and website that carries news stories about entrepreneurship, small business management, and business.\n- Entrepreneur was first published in 1977.\n- Optimize was an American monthly business magazine published from November 2001 to June 2007.\n- In 2007, Entrepreneur magazine ranked Lifted Research Group number 5 on its Hot 500 list of fastest-growing companies.\n- Entrepreneur publishes 12 issues annually and is available through subscription and on newsstands.",
